node.doctext:
When you strip off the header the line endings remain.  Try deleting "\n" characters.  If on windows also delete "\r" characters.

<code>
# Remove fasta header line
if ( $para =~ s/^>(.*)//m ){
    $name = $1;
};
# Remove comment line(s)
$para =~ s/^\s*#.*//mg;

$para =~ tr/\r\n//d;
</code>
